'''Pogo Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] increases its attack power, lowers its cost and increases the chance to survive a lethal strike to 100%. [[Talents]] were later added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Pogo Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

